  "story": {
    "title": "My Best Friend The Cat",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "I had a cute cat. Her name was lucy. She was my best friend. One day my Grandma came, she had a dog. The dog was very angry when it came to my house. It started to chase Lucy.",
      "Meanwhile, it got dark and Lucy climbed and hid on the tree and the dog also got tired searching Lucy. It slept under the same tree. Lucy was also tired and she started Meowing",
      "Lucy very quietly climbed down the tree and tip toed into the home. we both slept together. Grandma took her dog with her."
    ],
