        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_120729/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Lucy cũng mệt và bắt đầu kêu meo meo."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Lucy very quietly climbed down the tree and tip toed into the home.",
